@title Top bar: workspace segment, undo and redo, page switcher, dark and light
@area Layout
# Lane V2a of the visual redesign (docs/design/visual-redesign.md section 3.1).
fresh
wait 20
click_text "Open example"
wait 40
shot bar-dark
expect "Undo"
expect "Redo"
expect "Switch page"
check_layout
click_text "Switch page"
wait 8
expect "Add page"
shot page-switcher-dark
check_layout
text main
wait 6
shot page-switcher-filtered
key Escape
wait 6
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Light
wait 10
key Escape
wait 6
shot bar-light
click_text "Switch page"
wait 8
shot page-switcher-light
check_layout
